  - Trustworthy Autonomy
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for Physiophronesis, a decision-governance
  framework for autonomous laser powder bed fusion (LPBF) additive
  manufacturing. The framework governs autonomous in-process decisions
  through four sequential gates -- manufacturing-state assessment,
  conformal uncertainty quantification, statistical process-consistency
  verification, and intent-parameterized policy selection -- evaluated
  on the NIST AM Bench 2022 (AMB2022-01) public datasets with
  leave-one-build-out validation across builds B6, B7, and B8.
